ERRNOPROBE(1)

NAME
    errnoprobe - test errno-style error mapping

SYNOPSIS
    errnoprobe

DESCRIPTION
    Exercises userland errno behavior, including raw syscall negative errno
    values, POSIX wrapper errno mapping, strerror(3), and perror(3).

NOTES
    This is primarily a diagnostic or self-test helper, but it is documented so installed programs are discoverable.
